// The rivers, lakes, marshes and bogs of the north (V2-10 (e)): the Palearctic's and the
// Nearctic's beavers, muskrat, otters, mink and water vole; the ducks, geese and swans, herons,
// stork, crane, osprey and kingfisher; the pike, carp, catfish and eel; the turtles, toad and
